            <ArticleTitle>Effect of intermittent left anterior hemiblock on left ventricular function.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>216-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Studies of left ventricular function were performed during intermittent left anterior hemiblock, Max dP/dt and Vmax fell during left anterior hemiblock, with a rise in left ventricular end-diastolic pressure compared with a normally conducted beat.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
